---
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
AccessModifierOffset: 0
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: ForIndentation
ColumnLimit: 90
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
MaxEmptyLinesToKeep: 1
InsertNewlineAtEOF: true
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
IndentCaseLabels: true
SortIncludes: Never
PointerAlignment: Right
DerivePointerAlignment: false
# Formatting does not add required braces; clang-tidy checks their presence.
# Project CONTRIBUTING takes precedence over BARR's alternative layout.
# ColumnLimit is a formatting target; no separate hard 90-character gate.
# Comment style (// and Doxygen function comments) still requires review.
